GPUI Fast compatibility distribution

Derived from Longbridge GPUI Fast v0.1.8 at
d599978f0ecf794b16cb6ec0b5875f818b822507:
https://github.com/longbridge/gpui-fast

Generated with the upstream release exporter from source commit
90f1ec3153638082560f74a49440cf86bf7a893d:
https://github.com/dux-web/gpui-fast

Sailry contributors modified crates/gpui/src/fast/layout.rs and
crates/gpui/src/fast/tests/layout.rs to restore retained child links after
reparenting. The change is submitted upstream at
https://github.com/longbridge/gpui-fast/pull/68.

Sailry contributors also modified crates/gpui/src/fast/composition.rs,
crates/gpui_macos/src/fast/composition.rs and
crates/gpui_macos/src/window.rs to limit the default macOS overlay's input to
interactive GPUI hit regions while preserving native descendants and custom
GPUI surface input. The change is submitted upstream at
https://github.com/longbridge/gpui-fast/pull/69.

The upstream Apache-2.0 license and attribution notices are retained.
See LICENSE. The generated distribution adds modification notices to the
five changed source files; their code matches the source commit.
